    given-names: "G. D."
version: "0.13.0-research"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gpartin/LeanSchrodingerDerivation"
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of a thirteen-stage conditional nonrelativistic
  Schrodinger handoff. It proves exact positive-energy, rest-energy removal,
  rationalized kinetic-energy, correction-bound, chi-derived-potential, and
  single-plane-wave operator identities. The free-Dirac mass shell remains an
  explicit input; an arbitrary-wavefunction PDE, Born's rule, and a complete
  quantum theory are outside the proved scope.

